POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "device-demo@example.com", "password": "hula-4" }

###
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "device-demo@example.com", "password": "hula-5" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ATTACKER: kahit TAMANG password. Ang inaasahan: 423 — naka-lock ang lahat ng walang device cookie
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "device-demo@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. IKAW (may device_token mula sa #1). Ang inaasahan: 200 — hindi ka apektado ng atake ✅
###    (Bago ang Day 64: 423 dito — iyon ang lockout DoS)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "device-demo@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. PEKENG device cookie. Ang inaasahan: 423 — hindi tugma ang hash, kaya "walang cookie" din ang turing
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: device_token=gawa-gawa-lang

{ "email": "device-demo@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 🔍 Ang biktima sa BAGONG device (hal. bagong phone, walang cookie) ay naka-lock pa rin hanggang 15 minuto.
###    Ang labasan: "Nakalimutan ang password?" → reset (19-password-reset.http) — tinatanggal ang lock ng account,
###    binabawi ang tiwala ng lahat ng device, at pinagkakatiwalaan ang browser na nag-reset.
### 🔍 Hindi binubura ng LOGOUT ang device_token: hindi ito session — "ito ang dati kong browser" lang ang ibig sabihin.
### 🔍 Sa database (dev):
###      docker exec auth-learning-postgres-1 psql -U auth -d auth_learning \
###        -c "select id, user_id, failed_login_attempts, locked_until, expires_at from trusted_devices"
###    → hash lang ang naka-save (token_hash), hindi ang cookie mismo
